{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - User - Session - Okta Session Started via an Anonymising Proxy",
	"Description": "A session started from an address Okta flagged as an anonymising proxy or Tor exit. Users behind a corporate VPN do not normally trip this; a sign-in that does is either someone deliberately hiding where they are, or an adversary using commodity proxy infrastructure.\n\nEvent type: user.session.start with securityContext.isProxy true\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_user_session_start_via_anonymising_proxy/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/tree/master/rules/identity/okta",
	"GUID": "422b6952-b2f2-5bfb-8799-52031876bc27",
	"Labels": [
		"okta"
	],
